<title>INDONESIA: Bank Negara Indonesia sets offer price at 850 rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara Indonesia sets offer price at 850 rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned PT Bank Negara Indonesia (BNI), which plans to float shares in November, has set its offer price at 850 rupiah, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BNI, Indonesia's largest state-owned bank, plans to list about one billion shares, representing a 25 percent stake, on the Jakarta and Surabaya stock exchanges.</p>
